Date: Mon, 9 Jun 2025 12:33:55 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Revert "QCLINUX: firmware: qcom: si-core: Switch to tzmem
 interfaces"

This reverts commit 7e20e75b5a07648acc4c07d005b44182b9303f2d.

Change-Id: Ie48c14b0bef1ae64a73be5796d8d9878a5327c6a
Signed-off-by: Yingzhong Zha <yzha@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
